Z||000005||Fformula88||10-10-2001||01:57 PM||||I've got the new wheel (not the reconditioned) and am happy with it.  I didn't notice such an extreme change in the thickness as you have.  Maybe its a little meatier, but my hands cannot really tell the difference.  I do agree with you on those lousy rivets!  It was a pain (although slight) to get it all back together.  Bets part is it makes my Fiero smell like new leather inside!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
